      "id": "cart-pendulum-spring",
      "prefix": "m4c_cart_pendulum",
      "model": "DomelicaLab.Examples.CartPendulumSpring3D",
      "title": "A pendulum moves its spring-mounted cart",
      "description": "Release a 1 kg pendulum bob from 35\u00b0 on a 2 kg sliding cart attached to a 20 N/m wall spring. The cart translates while the unactuated hinge rotates. A massless rigid rod joins the pivot to the point mass; its sphere shows position and adds no rotational inertia. The six-second recording uses ideal joints and an undamped spring.",
